The charData folder contains charDataStore.ts, a module-level cache of the last known character vitals/ancillary snapshot. It mirrors the existing features/room/roomDataStore.ts pattern: useCharData.ts seeds its initial state from this cache and writes every update back to it, so remounting the hook (as happens when the HUD theme's shell swaps live) shows the last-known values immediately instead of flashing blank until the next game:char-data event. levelProgressStore.ts alongside it tracks level (login_data + event:level-up) and tnl (char_data) for the compact HUD's EXP bar, using the highest tnl seen since the last level-up as the level's exp span because GMCP does not send it.
